- Candidates 1–3 all touch `wiki/dev-tooling.md#scan-stamps` — gitignored per-clone `.docscan-last-run` already exists, reminder logic reads it, "nothing else writes it." New team record must define relationship to it, not silently duplicate. **Wiki duplication.**

